  "description": "Tired of his boss picking on him at any given opportunity, Kasey resigns from his job to go on a backpacking trip. He meets Dave, who from the very start is cold and rude towards him. As the two get closer, Kasey grows more and more attracted to Dave. But Kasey wasn’t supposed to stay in one place for long. What will happen to his backpacking trip? What will happen to them?\n\n(Source: BOMTOON, translated)",
